# IMG-03 — Responsive srcset / widths

## Rationale

Serving one large image to all viewports wastes bandwidth and hurts LCP on mobile.

## How to check

```bash
bun "<skill-dir>/scripts/cli.ts" check images <file>
```

Flags `<img>`/`image_tag` lacking `srcset`/`widths` for non-icon images.

## How to fix

Propose `image_tag` with `widths:` (e.g. `widths: '375, 750, 1100, 1500'`) and
an appropriate `sizes` attribute.
